@VivesRental.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7073

### Login (returns a JWT)
POST {{VivesRental.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### Products (paste the token from the login response)
GET {{VivesRental.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>
